    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">1D DP - pick or skip (circular)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/house-robber-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 213</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>House Robber II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The first and last houses are neighbours, so at least one of them is skipped: break the circle twice and run House Robber I on houses 0..n-2 and on 1..n-1, keeping the larger. n = 1 is the only special case. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
